      "message": "feat: cns-bridge substrate edition\n\nEvery USCP packet on the CNS bus is now a substrate cell with prev_hash chain.\n\n- SubstratePacket wraps USCP packet with substrate properties\n- SubstrateBus maintains prev_hash chain automatically\n- FNV-1a 64-bit hash (fleet canary verified)\n- HMAC-SHA256 signature preserved\n- 6/6 tests pass\n\nBased on SuperInstance/cns-bridge",
